ent-OrbitraRatvarPrism = prosperity prism
    .desc = A brass prism with a faint light and a sealed reservoir.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-prism = Prosperity Prism
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-prism-desc = Heals injured members of its cult within four tiles and stores extracted toxins. Requires transmission coverage and spends two energy per patient every two seconds. Destruction releases the captured toxins.
orbitra-ratvar-prism-status =
    Mode: { $enabled ->
        [true] enabled
       *[false] disabled
    }. Reservoir: { $volume }/{ $capacity } units. Captured toxins are released upon destruction.
